[["$","div",null,{"className":"w-14 h-14 bg-secondary-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-primary-600 transition-colors","children":["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-7 w-7 text-primary-700 group-hover:text-white transition-colors","children":[["$","path","g774vq",{"d":"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"}],["$","path","1pflzl",{"d":"m9 11 3 3L22 4"}],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-xl font-black text-secondary-900 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"Human Review"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-secondary-600 leading-relaxed font-medium","children":"No AI-generated research. Every guide is drafted and fact-checked by human experts."}]]}]]}]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"py-24 bg-secondary-50","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-white rounded-[3rem] p-8 md:p-16 shadow-xl border border-secondary-100","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-lg max-w-none prose-headings:text-secondary-900 prose-headings:font-black prose-headings:tracking-tight prose-p:text-secondary-700 prose-p:font-medium prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-a:text-primary-700 prose-a:font-bold hover:prose-a:underline","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl mb-8","children":"1. Our Research Philosophy"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["At SmartMoneyPath, we approach personal finance with the rigor of a research institution and the empathy of a neighbor. Our philosophy is rooted in ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"objectivity"}],". We understand that behind every data point—an interest rate, a fee, or a tax limit—is a real person making a decision that impacts their future."]}],["$","p",null,{"children":"We adhere to a \"math-first\" methodology. This means that before we write a single word of advice, we build a model. Whether we are comparing the long-term cost of a car loan or the compounding effect of a high-yield savings account, we start with the spreadsheets. By focusing on the numbers, we can filter out the marketing \"noise\" and focus on the \"signal\"—the actual value for the consumer."}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl mt-16 mb-8","children":"2. The 5-Step Evaluation Process"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Every product or guide that appears on our site undergoes a multi-step evaluation process that takes between 10 and 40 hours of primary research:"}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"space-y-4","children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Market Scan:"}]," We identify products through consumer feedback, regulatory filings, and industry monitoring."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Data Collection:"}]," We extract raw data from the provider's official \"Terms and Conditions\" and \"Truth in Savings\" disclosures."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Verification:"}]," We cross-reference data against third-party databases and reach out to institutions to clarify ambiguous language."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Scoring:"}]," Data points are fed into our category-specific scoring models."]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Editorial Analysis:"}]," A senior editor reviews the findings to ensure they provide a complete picture of risk and reward."]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl mt-16 mb-8","children":"3. Data Sources We Trust"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"We do not rely on \"top 10\" lists from other websites or unsourced \"expert\" claims. Our data comes from high-authority, primary sources:"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 list-none pl-0","children":[["$","li",null,{"className":"bg-secondary-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-secondary-100 flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-file-text h-5 w-5 text-primary-600","children":[["$","path","1rqfz7",{"d":"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"}],["$","path","tnqrlb",{"d":"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"}],["$","path","b1mrlr",{"d":"M10 9H8"}],["$","path","t4e002",{"d":"M16 13H8"}],["$","path","z1uh3a",{"d":"M16 17H8"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold text-sm","children":"The Federal Reserve (FRED)"}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"bg-secondary-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-secondary-100 flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-file-text h-5 w-5 text-primary-600","children":[["$","path","1rqfz7",{"d":"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"}],["$","path","tnqrlb",{"d":"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4"}],["$","path","b1mrlr",{"d":"M10 9H8"}],["$","path","t4e002",{"d":"M16 13H8"}],["$","path","z1uh3a",{"d":"M16 17H8"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold text-sm","children":"IRS.gov"}]]}],["$","li",null,{"className":"bg-secondary-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-secondary-100 flex items-center gap-3","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-file-text h-5 w-5 text-primary-600","children":[["$","path","1rqfz7",{"d":"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"}],["$","path","tnqrlb",{"d":"M14 2v4a